# REV-217: keep the build context small and the images free of local state.
# Every Dockerfile copies explicit paths; this file stops those paths from carrying
# local node_modules, build output, secrets or tests into a layer.

# Dependencies and build output are produced inside the image
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage

# Version control, editors, agent and OS files
.git
.github
.claude
.idea
.vscode
**/.DS_Store

# Secrets and local environments (only the sample file may enter the context)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example

# Local data and logs
backups
**/*.log

# Tests and documents the build does not read
**/__tests__
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.test.ts
ba
docs
deploy
scripts
*.docx
*.md
**/*.md
